## Conclusion
Our analysis does not support the hypothesis that there's no significant difference in life satisfaction between Full-time and Non-full-time workers in Germany.
However, The sample size (N=440) may not be sufficient to detect small effects. For further analysis, it may be necessary to control for latent variables (age, gender, income, etc.), and cross-test for them.

